## 🛠️ Tech Stack

| Layer | Technology |
|-------|-----------|
| **Frontend** | React.js, React Router, Axios, CSS3 |
| **Backend** | Node.js, Express.js |
| **Database** | MongoDB, Mongoose |
| **Auth & Security** | JWT, bcrypt.js, cookie-parser, CORS |

